This container bundles qeeqbox/social-analyzer (commit 1ba0905e00d054aab833eb3693739c354db09e0f)
under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0.
Upstream source: https://github.com/qeeqbox/social-analyzer

The HTTP shim (shim_server.py) and MCP adapter (examples/mcp_server.py) are
separate from that AGPL component. Keep SocialAnalyzer inside this image;
do not copy upstream app.py into an agent repository.
